    "verdict_notes": "The reader's V4 'challenges' label is removed. V4 concerns manipulations that alter or force the response opening. Speculative decoding at T=0 is constructed to reproduce the target's greedy output (Leviathan guarantee), so a null is expected and says nothing about prefill, suffix, or sampling-parameter bypasses. The cited Wang2025SSD prefill cells (|h| up to 1.30) are another paper's results and are not recorded here."
